 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Tool Manipulation — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level you have learned to use tools offensively. As an action for 3 CE, you can create a blast of wind from an imbued tool you are holding. Or from a <em>Floating Tool</em> within 60 ft for 1 additional CE.<br />\n This creates a 10 feet wide, 60 feet long line. Creatures within range must make a Strength saving throw, taking 3d10 bludgeoning damage and pushed back 10 feet on a failed save or half as much on a success.<br />\n At 11th level, your <em>Wind Scythe</em> now deals 6d10 bludgeoning damage and a creature that fails their save is pushed back 20 feet and knocked prone.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
